@api = http://localhost:5080
@simulator = http://localhost:5090

### Exchange rate through the circuit breaker
GET {{api}}/api/exchange-rates?base=USD&target=EUR

### Circuit status, policy, metrics and events
GET {{api}}/api/circuit-breaker

### Manually reset (close) the circuit
POST {{api}}/api/circuit-breaker/reset

### Manually isolate (force open) the circuit
POST {{api}}/api/circuit-breaker/isolate

### Invalid currency code
GET {{api}}/api/exchange-rates?base=US1&target=EUR

### Provider behavior
GET {{simulator}}/admin/behavior

### Provider healthy
PUT {{simulator}}/admin/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "Healthy" }

### Provider always failing (HTTP 500)
PUT {{simulator}}/admin/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "Failing" }

### Provider slower than the configured timeout
PUT {{simulator}}/admin/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "Slow", "latencyMs": 5000 }

### Provider failing randomly
PUT {{simulator}}/admin/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "Intermittent", "failureRate": 0.6 }
